  "description": "Detects evidence that an actor attempted to remove forensic traces or tamper with logging on the host. Uses a tiered approach with audit-log clearance events (Security 1102 / System 104) and wiper-tool prefetch hits weighted highest, followed by mass-delete bursts in USN, RecycleBin context, and tampering with Defender / autostart / services as supporting context.",
  "proves": "An actor attempted to remove forensic traces or tamper with logging",
  "author": "Crow-Eye Team",
  "created_date": "2026-05-18T00:00:00Z",
